{"id":"unterlage","lemma":"Unterlage","pos":"noun","rank":2199,"glosses":["an underlay, a layer on which something else rests","a pad, mat, e.g. a blotter","rootstock (plant used as a base in grafting)"],"ipa":"/ˈʊntərˌlaːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/De-Unterlage.ogg/De-Unterlage.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Unterlage","plural":"Unterlagen"},"examples":[{"text":"Hier sind meine Unterlagen.","en":"Here are my papers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/699173","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Würden Sie sich bitte diese Unterlagen ansehen?","en":"Would you please have a look at these papers?","words":[{"g":"dignity","l":"Würde"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to look at"}]},{"text":"Reichen Sie Ihre Unterlagen ein.","en":"Hand in your papers.","words":[{"g":"to reach"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Ich benötige diese Unterlagen.","en":"I need those documents.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need, to require","l":"benötigen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat Unterlagen für dich.","en":"Tom has some documents for you.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"you","l":"du"}]}]}